<section class="atmos-ice blend-top-light blend-bottom-dark relative overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20"><div aria-hidden="true" class="aurora aurora-electric aurora-drift-a -left-32 top-0 size-[30rem] opacity-[0.10]"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="aurora aurora-electric aurora-drift-b -right-24 bottom-0 size-[26rem] opacity-[0.14]"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="aurora aurora-electric left-1/2 top-1/2 size-[42rem] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-[0.12]"></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center text-center mx-auto max-w-3xl"><h2 data-words class="text-balance text-3xl leading-[1.18] sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem] text-foreground font-medium"><span data-hl="circle" class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap">Por que</span> o inglês trava justo na <span data-hl="line" class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap">hora de falar?</span></h2></div></div><div class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:80ms"><div class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl space-y-1.5 text-center text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><p>Talvez você já tenha começado a estudar inglês outras vezes.</p><p>Aprendeu regras, assistiu a vídeos, fez exercícios, baixou aplicativos.</p><p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Mas na hora de falar, as palavras não aparecem.</p></div></div><ul class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-3xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div class="thought thought-1 h-full"><div class="card-frost group relative h-full overflow-hidden p-5"><span class="relative font-serif text-3xl leading-none text-gold">“</span><p class="relative mt-1 font-serif text-lg font-medium italic leading-snug text-foreground">Eu entendo, mas travo para responder.</p></div></div></li><li class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:60ms"><div class="thought thought-2 h-full"><div class="card-frost group relative h-full overflow-hidden p-5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-12 size-32 rounded-full bg-electric/10 blur-3xl"></span><span class="relative font-serif text-3xl leading-none text-gold">“</span><p class="relative mt-1 font-serif text-lg font-medium italic leading-snug text-foreground">Eu estudo e depois esqueço.</p></div></div></li><li class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:120ms"><div class="thought thought-3 h-full"><div class="card-frost group relative h-full overflow-hidden p-5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-12 size-32 rounded-full bg-electric/10 blur-3xl"></span><span class="relative font-serif text-3xl leading-none text-gold">“</span><p class="relative mt-1 font-serif text-lg font-medium italic leading-snug text-foreground">Tenho vergonha de falar errado.</p></div></div></li><li class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:180ms"><div class="thought thought-4 h-full"><div class="card-frost group relative h-full overflow-hidden p-5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-7 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-electric/50 to-transparent"></span><span class="relative font-serif text-3xl leading-none text-gold">“</span><p class="relative mt-1 font-serif text-lg font-medium italic leading-snug text-foreground">Não tenho uma hora por dia para estudar.</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="reveal" data-visible="false" style="transition-delay:120ms"><div class="mx-auto mt-7 flex max-w-2xl flex-col items-center text-center"><div class="h-px w-16 hairline-gold"></div><p data-words="100" class="mt-4 font-serif text-xl font-medium leading-snug text-foreground sm:text-2xl">O que costuma faltar é uma <em data-hl="line" class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap text-primary">sequência clara de aprendizado</em> e contato frequente com o idioma.</p></div></div></div></secti